</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AAA24033001">
<title>
Voltage and Signal Check
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect service wires (3) between blind spot monitor control module (1) and connector (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check voltage and/or pulse signal of blind spot monitor control module using voltmeter (4) and oscilloscope (5).
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Voltage of terminal with asterisk (*) cannot be measured by voltmeter because it is pulse signal. Check it with oscilloscope if necessary.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
